created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:47.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:47.000000Z"},{"id":5448419,"review":"Positive:\nThe property was clean and was value for money\n\nNegative:\nThere was no super market close although they had a care taker who was ready to take care of all your shopping needs","rental_id":224777,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:47.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:47.000000Z"},{"id":5460336,"review":"Positive:\nNo comment\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":224777,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:51.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:51.000000Z"},{"id":5460337,"review":"Positive:\nGreat all around and the space as well and area and the family that was there assisting us\n\nNegative:\nN/a","rental_id":224777,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:51.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:51.000000Z"},{"id":5475059,"review":"Positive:\nالشقة تقع في مجمع سكني راقٍ (كمباوند) وهو مكان آمِن ومناسب جدًّا للعائلات. الشقة فسيحة جدًّا وتطل على حديقة أنيقة. استجابة الإخوة والأخوات من إدارة الشقق فوق الممتازة. لقد حظيتُ بإقامة ممتعة جدًّا بصحبة الأسرة.\n\nNegative:\nنظام السخانات سيِّئ جدًّا، إذ يتحول الماء من الساخن إلى البارد في لحظات، أرجو إصلاحه لكي تستحقوا 10 من 10 عن جدارة.","rental_id":224777,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:53.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:53.000000Z"},{"id":5478581,"review":"Positive:\nNo comment\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":224777,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:53.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:53.000000Z"},{"id":5479174,"review":"Positive:\nNo comment\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":224777,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:53.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:53.000000Z"},{"id":5495830,"review":"Positive:\nNo comment\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":224777,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:56.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:56.000000Z"},{"id":5529756,"review":"Positive:\nجيد جدا\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":224777,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:58.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:58.000000Z"},{"id":5533524,"review":"Positive:\nOnce you enter the compound, you immediately feel safe. The area is calm and serene, quite nice for an early morning or late-night walk. People at the compound gate bear great respect for the villa owner. The villa facade is remarkably surrounded by a line of trees and lights that impress Uber drivers and delivery men.\r\nCheck-in was easy. The flat is spacious and very clean, and the neighbors are amazingly friendly. The kitchen has a nice stove, microwave, big fridge, water boiler, etc, and many shelves, with a nice bar. The bedrooms are comfortable, each having its own toilet, where sleeping is a most enjoyable experience, especially when you open the windows for an early-morning breeze. I ordered extra blankets, and they arrived the same day, within a couple of hours.\r\nSitting on the balcony is stunning, especially as you chit-chat while enjoying the view of a pool in the middle of a small garden, let alone sitting in the dedicated TV corner in the hall.\r\nThe value for money is really worth it.\n\nNegative:\nYou must have a car or call an Uber, as the villa is away from everything. There are no grocery shops or stores around, and the nearest mall (Miraj) is a 20-minute walk. The bathroom water is cold (even on warm days) due to a water heater issue. The liquid soap container is diluted with water (bring your own soap and shampoo with you). The vintage elevator suddenly jerks when it starts to move (and it has no safety door); you can take the few steps to the first floor. Some of the kitchenware might be upsetting (scratched, bring your own), and the coffee machine doesn't work.","rental_id":224777,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:58.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:58.000000Z"},{"id":6141083,"review":"Very nice and elegant spacious flat","rental_id":224777,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:35.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:35.000000Z"},{"id":6150775,"review":"전체적으로 가격대비 만족스러운 숙소였습니다. 몇가지 불편한 점은 일단 숙소가 단지안에 있어서 조용하고 안전하고 좋은데 주변에 이 더운 날씨에 도보로 갈만한 편의시설은 없어 조금 아쉽고, 대신 우버로 10-15분 거리에 쇼핑몰이 많이 있어 크게 불편하지는 않았습니다. 한가지 아쉬운 점은 휴지나, 키친타올이 추가로 비치되어있지 않아 불편하고, 가스렌지가 점화가 되지 않고 성능도 떨어져 음식을 하는 데는 많이 불편해서 새것으로 교체를 하시길 바랍니다. 좋은 점은 바닥이 대리석이라 전체적으로 집이 시원한 편이고 에어컨도 충분히 설치되어 있어 냉방은 아주 잘 되어 있고, 가구들이 무채색으로 차분한 느낌이라 안정된 느낌, 특히 방들이나 거실이 크고 식탁도 커서 일하기에도 아주 편합니다.  감사합니다.","rental_id":224777,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:37.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:37.000000Z"},{"id":6156208,"review":"الحي جميل وهادي ومنظم \nبخصوص الوحدة السكنية كانت كبيرة وتكيف بالكامل والقائم عليها متعاون لكن الاثاث نوعا ما مستهلك بالذات الصالة وغرف الجلوس تحتاج تجديد","rental_id":224777,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:37.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:37.000000Z"},{"id":6172051,"review":"المكان يحتاج للنظافه والكنب وسخ والسجاده ومفارش السارير وغبار كثير موجود","rental_id":224777,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:42.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:42.000000Z"}],"amenities":[]}